  "content": "<p><img alt=\"图标\" width=\"100\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TerminalMC/GolemsKillCreepers/HEAD/common/src/main/resources/assets/golemskillcreepers/icon.png\"></p><h2>铁傀儡击杀苦力怕</h2><p>一个轻量级模组，添加两条游戏规则，允许铁傀儡攻击并秒杀苦力怕。</p><h3>游戏规则</h3><p>自 1.21.11 版本起</p><ul>\n<li><code>golemskillcreepers:iron_golems_attack_creepers</code><ul>\n<li>控制铁傀儡是否主动攻击苦力怕</li>\n<li>默认值：<code>true</code></li></ul></li>\n<li><code>golemskillcreepers:iron_golems_instakill_creepers</code><ul>\n<li>控制铁傀儡攻击时是否对苦力怕造成最大伤害</li>\n<li>默认值：<code>true</code></li></ul></li>\n</ul><p>1.21.11 版本之前</p><ul>\n<li><code>doIronGolemsAttackCreepers</code><ul>\n<li>控制铁傀儡是否主动攻击苦力怕</li>\n<li>默认值：<code>true</code></li></ul></li>\n<li><code>doIronGolemsInstakillCreepers</code><ul>\n<li>控制铁傀儡攻击时是否对苦力怕造成最大伤害</li>\n<li>默认值：<code>true</code></li></ul></li>\n</ul><h3>联系方式</h3><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.terminalmc.dev%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1103153365216669797?logo=discord&amp;label=Discord Server&amp;color=#5865F2\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/TerminalMC/GolemsKillCreepers/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/TerminalMC/GolemsKillCreepers?logo=github&amp;label=GitHub Issues\" alt=\"问题反馈\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/TerminalMC/GolemsKillCreepers/blob/HEAD/LICENSE.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/TerminalMC/GolemsKillCreepers?label=License&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"许可证\"></a></p>",
